        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Fantastic Mr. Fox, Khan Kluay\n- People: Roald Dahl, Jason Schwartzman, Wes Anderson, King Naresuan\n- Companies: Kantana Group\n- Topics: Animation, film collaborations\n\nFacts:\n- Fantastic Mr. Fox is a 2009 American stop-motion animated comedy film based on Roald Dahl's children's novel of the same name.\n- Khan Kluay is a 2006 Thai 3D computer-animated action-adventure comedy family feature film set during Ayutthaya-era Siam about a Thai elephant who becomes the war elephant for King Naresuan.\n- Kantana Group is known for animation work that includes the 2006 feature film Khan Kluay.\n- Jason Schwartzman is known for frequent collaborations with Wes Anderson, including Fantastic Mr. Fox in 2009.",
